/* shader-presets.js -- the Retro Engine's grouped preset library.
   Original GLSL for the runner contract: void mainImage + iResolution/iTime/iMouse/iFrame,
   plus iAudio (bass, mid, treble, level) and the live user knobs iKnobA/B/C. Every preset is
   compile-tested in real WebGL1 AND verified bright through the full pipeline (renderRetro +
   palette + CRT), and the audio-reactive ones are checked to still read at silence: sound adds
   motion, it is never the only light. Grounded in the operator's corpus (Crystal City, the
   Aperture, the Membrane, the Witnesses, Emet/Met) and the aesthetics he reaches back to:
   Evangelion, the PlayStation/CRT/Game Boy era, denpa glitch, op-art, cross-era hybrids. */

